  "notes": "Vittia Fertilizantes e Biol\u00f3gicos (VITT3) \u2014 S\u00e3o Joaquim da Barra-SP based specialty fertilizer + bio-input producer. Three product lines: (1) fertilizantes especiais (foliar, organominerais, condicionadores de solo), (2) defensivos biol\u00f3gicos (bionematicidas/biofungicidas/bioinseticidas \u2014 fungos like Trichoderma, bact\u00e9rias like Bacillus), (3) inoculantes (rhizobium for soja, azospirillum for corn/cana). IPO on B3 Novo Mercado October 2021 (R$355M primary + secondary at R$11/share). BRL reporting, calendar fiscal year. grossRevenueMM = receita bruta, revenueMM = receita l\u00edquida. Expense split: CPV (cost of product sold), G&A (despesas gerais e administrativas), D&A (deprecia\u00e7\u00e3o), Outras (comerciais/P&D). Higher EBITDA margins (~22-25%) than commodity ag-input distributors due to specialty/biological mix. Brazilian biofertilizer market grew 30%+ CAGR 2020-2024 driven by integrated pest management adoption. 5-year FY history from CVM ITR/DFP filings + ri.vittia.com.br release decks. Pre-IPO 2020 figures from Prospecto Definitivo. Capex into new Uberaba-MG facility 2023-2024. Net debt remained low \u2014 strong cash conversion.",
